From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: mediatek: validate CCD CQ replies and capture completion

Pinned ISP7SP ABI, explicit output layout, bounded vendor DONE snapshot.
No production registration, firmware surrogate or DT activation.

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/seninf/mt6878-camera-ipi-abi.h b/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/seninf/mt6878-camera-ipi-abi.h
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/seninf/mt6878-camera-ipi-abi.h
@@ -0,0 +1,530 @@
